name: regime-adjacent
kind: inferred
shape: categorical
face: in
membrane: false
note: |
  The operating posture shifted without the belief underneath shifting:
  enforcement tightened, a default flipped, a cadence changed — the same
  discipline applied harder. Distinct from `regime-change` (membrane:
  the way we work or understand the domain itself moved, owed a concept
  evolution) — regime-adjacent is the same belief with teeth.

  Declared 2026-09-19 with the invariant gate's flip from advisory to
  GATE_BLOCK=1 enforcing across five repos: the rules didn't change;
  their reach and consequence did.
route: surface
